---
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; import CTASection from '@/components/CTASection.astro'; import SiteLayout from '@/components/SiteLayout.astro'; import { siteName } from '@/lib/site';
---
<SiteLayout title={`About Emil | ${siteName}`} description="Meet Emil Jayasekara, an experienced Sri Lanka chauffeur guide." canonicalPath="/about/"><Breadcrumbs items={[{href:'/',label:'Home'},{label:'About Emil'}]} /><section class="container-shell grid gap-8 py-8 lg:grid-cols-[.78fr_1.22fr] lg:items-center"><img src="/images/driver-guides/emil/emil-profile.webp" alt="Emil Jayasekara, Sri Lanka chauffeur guide" width="949" height="949" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-[1.75rem] object-cover shadow-soft" /><div class="card-surface p-6 md:p-8"><p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-lotus">Your chauffeur guide</p><h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl text-ink sm:text-5xl">Meet Emil Jayasekara</h1><div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-ink/72"><p>Emil began his driving career in 1986 and has spent decades travelling Sri Lanka’s roads. Since moving into tourism, he has combined that experience with a love of sharing the island’s culture, landscapes and local life.</p><p>His approach is personal and practical: plan a comfortable route, welcome guests warmly, and adapt the journey around what matters to them. From ancient cities and misty hill country to wildlife parks and the coast, Emil helps make the island feel easy to explore.</p></div><a href="/plan-my-tour/" class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-full bg-leaf px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Plan My Tour with Emil</a></div></section><CTASection title="Ready to begin your Sri Lanka journey?" description="Tell Emil your dates, interests and travel style, and he will help plan the right private route." href="/plan-my-tour/" label="Plan My Tour" /></SiteLayout>
